        "A change by an arithmetic element preserves the integrand; translating by cⱼ moves the argument to cⱼy. Chartwise constants may depend on j.",
        "For A=0 the same estimate bounds the volume of the fundamental domain. For form coefficients the moment order is chosen for the square of the coefficient growth."
